cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use cgload, please cite it as below."
title: "cgload"
abstract: >-
  Loads a genome assembly and its annotation (GFF3, GenBank, eggNOG-mapper and
  InterProScan output) into SQLite, PostgreSQL or MySQL in one transaction, and
  checks the stored features and parent links against an independent count of
  the input files.
type: software
license: MIT
version: "0.2.1"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
repository-code: "https://github.com/computational-genomics-lab/cgload"
